BA feasibility review for epic {{.id}}: "{{.title}}".

Compare research findings against the epic PRD from a business perspective.

READ:
(1) All 6 epic PRD files at {{.file_path}} (epic.md, personas.md, user-journeys.md, requirements.md, success-metrics.md, scope.md)
(2) Research report from the research phase
(3) Other epic PRDs under docs/plan/ for cross-epic awareness

EVALUATE:
(1) Cross-epic conflicts -- does research reveal overlap or contradiction with other epics?
(2) Market viability -- do research findings support or undermine the business case?
(3) Scope coherence -- do requirements still make sense given what research uncovered?
(4) Business risk -- are there showstopper business concerns?

PRODUCE: BA feasibility review report with findings for each area, overall assessment (APPROVED or CONCERNS_FOUND), and recommended actions.

IF APPROVED: Advance via shark epic next-status {{.id}}.

IF CONCERNS FOUND: Set intervention_required via shark epic update {{.id}} --status=intervention_required, and write a structured intervention report detailing what's wrong, options, and recommended action.
